00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:21.680
'Ανοιξε τα...


00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:34.640
# Everything


00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:39.480
# Everything


00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:44.920
# Everything


